[(is also defined. This header is also present in the properties of scalars,)]
[(the rest of the properties shows field values for the template and the)]
[(array's values. The file also shows this after the header, but the it lists)]
[(the data for all scalars \050which are three in this example\051.)]
] 14 -0 0 0 false DrawText
